🔥 Layer Responsibilities
domain/

Only struct models.

Example:

package domain

import "time"

type Product struct {
	ID        int64
	Name      string
	Slug      string
	IsActive  bool
	CreatedAt time.Time
	UpdatedAt time.Time
}


No JSON tags here.

Domain = pure business.

repository/

Talks to PostgreSQL.

Uses database/sql or pgx.

Example:

type ProductRepository interface {
	FindAll(ctx context.Context) ([]domain.Product, error)
}


Implementation uses SQL.

service/

Business logic.

Example:

Validate stock

Calculate total

Update order total after adding item

Important: Order total must be recalculated inside service.

handler/

Gin layer.

Only:

Bind JSON

Call service

Return JSON

Never put SQL here.

