🧱 Important Architectural Rules
1️⃣ Price ALWAYS comes from product_variants

Never trust client price.

2️⃣ Order total must be recalculated from order_items

Never trust frontend total.

3️⃣ Use transaction when:

Creating order

Adding item

Updating total

Because ecommerce = consistency critical.

